# Where the landing page's "Get Started" CTA points: the console's sign-in
# screen. A plain cross-origin link on purpose -- the two apps are separate
# builds on separate origins with no cross-origin token handoff, which is what
# lets them ship independently. Do not turn this into a shared session.
#
# 127.0.0.1, never localhost: uvicorn binds IPv4 only and Windows resolves
# localhost to ::1 first (208ms wasted per request, invisible server-side).
VITE_CONSOLE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5175/auth/sign-in
